	(text "Hold Power >=7.5 s for an independent 400 ms EN reset. Release before retry.\nHold Mode low during that reset for ROM USB download through the four contacts.\nInternal EN/BOOT service pads remain available before molding. No dock reset pin required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0cf59463-8112-5ff3-b6bf-79ee4abc52c7")
	)
	(text "GPIO1 POWER_N is a diode-OR of the physical switch and active-low dock presence.\nWhile docked, firmware must suppress GPIO1 button gestures and deep sleep.\nU71 watches the separate raw physical switch, so docking never starts its timer."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 132.08 0)
		(effects
